    "text": "The Mystic - Mid-Level\nThe world is older and stranger than anyone admits. You know because you work there.\n\nDimensional Step for positioning without line of sight. Ward shapes the battlefield. Curse every turn as a\nfree Bonus Action adds consistent pressure at zero Action cost.\n\nClass: Warden | Origin: Mystic | Hit Die: d8 | Power Die: d10 | Speed: 30 ft HP: 44 (d8 max +\nCON score 14)x2) | PRO: +2 | Starting Edge: 2 | Save Training: WIS, CON\n\nAbility Scores\n\nStrength\n(STR)\nDexterity\n(DEX)\nConstitution\n(CON)\nFighting\n(FIG)\nIntelligence\n(INT)\nWisdom\n(WIS)\nCharisma\n(CHA)\nPerception\n(PER)\n10 / +0 12 / +1 14 / +2 8 / -1 15 / +2 20 / +5 17 / +3 13 / +1\n\nOrigin (Mystic) applies +2 WIS, +1 CHA before the above scores.\n\nActive Defense *(roll 1d20 + bonus shown; bonus = modifier + PRO)\n\nParry/Block (FIG) Dodge (DEX) Willpower (WIS) Social (CHA) Initiative\n1d20+2 1d20+4 1d20+8 1d20+7 1d20+4\n\nEffect Value (WIS): 10 + +5 + PRO = 17\n\nEldritch Bolt uses INT+PRO to hit vs Willpower.\n\nOrigin - Mystic\n\nScore bonuses +2 WIS, +1 CHA\nOrigin Skill Occult\nBuilt-in Merit Mystic Attunement 1\nBuilt-in Flaw Supernatural Burden 1\nOrigin Talent Ward the Soul: Once/encounter, when you or an\nally within 30 ft makes a save against fear, charm,\npossession, curse, psychic intrusion, or mystical\nmanipulation, add PRO (+2) to that roll.\n\nPower Sets\n\n- Sorcery 2 (WIS governs) - Command of dimensional and binding magic. Wards persist between\nencounters.\n\n- Spirit Touch 1 (WIS governs) - Communicate with and influence nearby spirits.\n\nPowers\n\nEldritch Bolt (At-Will \u00b7 Action): Attack 1d20+1 (INT+PRO) vs Willpower. 2d10\u22121 [10] psychic. Curse\n(At-Will \u00b7 Bonus Action): WIS Effect Value 17 vs Willpower. On failure: Disadvantage on their next attack\nroll or save. Mystic Binding (Encounter \u00b7 Action): WIS Effect Value 17 vs STR. Restrained. Ward\n(Encounter \u00b7 Action): Magical barrier at Short range. Creatures crossing: WIS save vs EV 17 or Pushed\nback and Dazed. Dimensional Step (Encounter \u00b7 Bonus Action): Teleport up to Short range. No line of\nsight required. Personal Force Field (Encounter \u00b7 Reaction): Reduce incoming damage by 2d10+5 [16].\nSpirit Sight (Utility): See invisible creatures, spirits, and dimensional rifts within Short range.\n\nClass Features *(Level 1 only)\n\n- Inner Fortress: Advantage on WIS saves. Immune to being Charmed.\n\n- Still Center: Once/encounter as a Bonus Action, end one mental condition on yourself or one ally\nwithin Close range.\n\nSkills\n\nOccult (Origin) \u00b7 Notice \u00b7 Insight \u00b7 Influence\n\nTalents *(Level 1 - two total)\n\n- Origin Talent: Ward the Soul\n\n- Starting Talent: Iron-Willed - *Advantage on WIS saves against mental effects.\n\nCalling - Idealist\n\n- 1 Edge: Uphold your code in a situation where doing so creates real friction or disadvantage.\n\n- 2 Edge: Refuse to compromise your ideal when confronted by power, facing real consequences.\n\n- 3 Edge: Be genuinely tested in your conviction and pay something real to hold it.\n\nMerits & Flaws\n\nMerits: Mystic Attunement 1 (Origin) \u00b7 Mentor 1\n\nFlaws: Supernatural Burden 1 (Origin) \u00b7 Enemy 2 (occult) \u00b7 Secret 1\n\nPlaying this hero: Dimensional Step for positioning without line of sight. Ward shapes the battlefield.\nCurse every turn as a Bonus Action adds consistent pressure at zero Action cost. Spirit Sight reveals\nthings nobody else can perceive."
