    "calling": "Idealist",
    "powerSets": "- Super Strength 3 (STR governs) - Continental force.\n\n- Energy Generation 3 (DEX governs) - Full energy suite at Tier 3 scale.\n\n- Regeneration 2 (CON governs) - Recover PRO + CON mod (6) HP at start of each Turn.\n\n- Flight 3 (Utility Core Power) - Flying speed 300 ft per Turn. Orbital out of combat.\n\n- Super Senses 1 (PER governs) - Cannot be surprised.",
    "powers": "Mighty Blow (At-Will \u00b7 Action): Attack 1d20+4 vs Parry/Block. 3d12+6 [25] bludgeoning. Energy Bolt\n(At-Will \u00b7 Action): Attack 1d20+5 vs Dodge. 3d12+3 [22]. Medium range. Ground Strike (Encounter \u00b7\nAction): STR Effect Value 18 vs DEX, Short area. Prone, Dazed, pushed 20 ft. Energy Burst (Encounter\n\u00b7 Action): Attack 1d20+5 vs Dodge, Short area. 3d12+3 [22]. Energy Shield (Encounter \u00b7 Reaction):\nReduce incoming damage by 3d12+3 [22]. Solar Flare (Daily \u00b7 Action): Attack 1d20+5, Medium area.\n6d12 [39] maximum radiant. CON Effect Value 13 vs CON or Blinded until end of next Turn. Once per\nday ( - ): When reduced to 0 HP, drop to 1 HP instead.",
